Cell["\<\
Dropping the far vertex breaks inextensibility, so the truncation is no \
longer a ray.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"adf260ab-b0ea-4e16-92d5-7096443f2daf"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", "\n", "  ", 
